  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">企鵝世界</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">1.18.2+ 需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">GeckoLib&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/610/296/64/64/637992132031410062.png\" alt=\"GeckoLibImage\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">此模組可能與 OptiFine 不相容！</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">企鵝世界是一個為遊戲新增 11 種企鵝的模組，它們會在世界中自然生成。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">每種企鵝都會在類似其現實生活中棲息地的生物群落中生成。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">以下是所有企鵝的列表！</span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/514/25/allthepenguins.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
